EVIDENCE (read-only inventories, filed under this commission):
- Architecture reality: ~/workspace/funnel-docs/moor-chain-of-command/evidence-architecture.md (40 sections, file:line citations, 14 UNKNOWNs). Key corrections: kernel lives at funnel/loop-build/funnel-kernel.js (production: moor-recovery/funnel-kernel.js); cognition bridge exposes 17 authority-free callables (not 41); entries vs product_generator GENERATOR registry conflict mitigated only by import-order convention; practice runner ships probe-to-refuse functions; verifier structurally cannot be gaslit by runner; no central metrics pipeline; direct-push entrance has doctrine but no code; no coordinator-context/task-owner lookup beyond registry authority strings.
- SOP reality: ~/workspace/funnel-docs/moor-chain-of-command/evidence-sops.md (27 SOPs: 21 full, 6 DRAFT; 21 advisory/bypassable, mechanically load-bearing only where code gates: agent-relay, funnel-run, moor-relay-edit, moor-release, quiz-funnel, feed-payload-safeguards, stage-completion convention; no runtime code references any bp:sop-* slug — SOPs are read by agents, never called by machinery; real change-approval exists for only 2 of 27; 20 governance gaps incl. C1 worker-protocol version dispute, C2 pages-deploy contradiction, agent-relay self-integrity hole).
- Existing roles: MOOR-BLUEPRINT-SOP.md records PL Sebastian -> chiefs/leads -> workers, five recursive planning layers, FAIL means do not ship.
- Coordinator-failure forensics: coordinator ended as completed with work remaining, zero durable task list, no expected-vs-actual accounting; remediated by heartbeat convention + watchdog.py (detect_stall/classify_packets/resume_plan) + run_stalled records + observatory STALLED badge.
- Owner intent: formal chain of command with ranks, branches, echelons, units, qualifications, SOP governance, review bodies, promotion, succession, training, mission ownership, escalation, durable command continuity. Military analogy is organizational, not cosmetic. RANK != AUTHORITY/TRUTH/CAPABILITY/SENIORITY/COMMAND. The proven depth of the base Funnel should provide the reference ladder for machine rank (investigate truthfully; do not equate version strings with authority). SOP-before-task must be load-bearing: resolve -> version -> qualification check -> present -> sign -> bound packet -> begin; no signature = no start. Consensus governs procedure; evidence governs truth; the Verifier does not salute rank.

QUESTION (owner-commissioned, Funnel to derive):
Given Moor's actual architecture, how should machines, Funnels, workers, generators, children, practice environments, SOPs, and responsibilities be organized into a durable chain of command that:
1. preserves owner authority;
2. preserves verifier independence;
3. gives every substantial task a responsible command chain;
4. makes qualifications explicit;
5. makes SOP compliance load-bearing;
6. distributes review among appropriately qualified machines;
7. prevents arbitrary doctrine changes;
8. permits specialized branches and echelons;
9. permits parallel work without parallel authority;
10. guarantees command continuity when any coordinator stops;
11. allows experience and time-in-rank to influence governance without manufacturing epistemic truth;
12. keeps all authority traceable from top to bottom and all evidence traceable from bottom to top?
Do not impose a fake Army structure. Derive only what the evidence supports; mark the rest UNKNOWN.
